    <string name="floor_calib_title">Floor level calibration</string>
    <string name="floor_calib_help">Corrects a fixed sensor-mounting tilt against a true-level reference (bubble level) — unlike per-boot calibration, this persists across reboots. Place the device on a known-flat, truly level surface, keep it still, then tap Start.</string>
    <string name="floor_calib_start">Start calibration</string>
    <string name="floor_calib_start_confirm">Place the device on a known-flat, truly level surface (e.g. next to a bubble level) and keep it still for a few seconds once started.</string>
